{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The plugin is a separate package that you need to install:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"yarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Usage"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query"},{"type":"text","value":" to the plugins section of your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".eslintrc"},{"type":"text","value":" configuration file:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"]\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Then configure the rules you want to use under the rules section:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/no-deprecated-options\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/prefer-query-object-syntax\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"recommended-config","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Recommended config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can also enable all the recommended rules for our plugin. Add "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended"},{"type":"text","value":" in extends:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended\"]\n}","lang":"json"}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"usage","text":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"recommended-config","text":"Recommended config","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes.\n\n## Installation\n\nThe plugin is a separate package that you need to install:\n\n```bash\nnpm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nAdd `@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query` to the plugins section of your `.eslintrc` configuration file:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"]\n}\n```\n\nThen configure the rules you want to use under the rules section:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/no-deprecated-options\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/prefer-query-object-syntax\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Recommended config\n\nYou can also enable all the recommended rules for our plugin. Add `plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended` in extends:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended\"]\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: eslint-plugin-query\ntitle: ESLint Plugin Query\n---\n\nTanStack Query comes with its own ESLint plugin. This plugin is used to enforce best practices and to help you avoid common mistakes.\n\n## Installation\n\nThe plugin is a separate package that you need to install:\n\n```bash\nnpm i -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add -D @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@4\n```\n\n## Usage\n\nAdd `@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query` to the plugins section of your `.eslintrc` configuration file:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"plugins\": [\"@tanstack/query\"]\n}\n```\n\nThen configure the rules you want to use under the rules section:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"@tanstack/query/exhaustive-deps\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/no-deprecated-options\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/prefer-query-object-syntax\": \"error\",\n    \"@tanstack/query/stable-query-client\": \"error\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Recommended config\n\nYou can also enable all the recommended rules for our plugin. Add `plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended` in extends:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"extends\": [\"plugin:@tanstack/eslint-plugin-query/recommended\"]\n}\n```\n"}
